      "id": "claim_f0462587c56c44d682963d6495f19d40",
      "statement": "Sessions live under the Pi agent directory (sessions default to <agentDir>/sessions, overridable via PI_CODING_AGENT_SESSION_DIR); sessionIndex discovers files recursively and reuses parsed SessionInfo keyed by a size/mtime/ctime/ino fingerprint, and listAllSessions falls back to pi SessionManager.listAll() when the index is unavailable, resolving each cwd to its project root so worktrees group under the main repository.",
